{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文於節目中推介建滔積層板(1888)，看好覆銅板需求旺盛，產業鏈年內多次加價，加上建滔母企及大股東近期持續增持。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Hpm26m5YUm1791347810.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議53元買入，目標價65元，止蝕價45元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">建滔積層板(1888)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$53</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$65</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$45</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jIBtj6LyxB1791347780.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦推介九龍倉置業(1997)，指公司增加派息提升吸引力，加上公司正重組資產配置，預料將提升盈利效率。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026eysfgczmWN1791347831.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議現價、即30.16元買入，目標價35元，暫不設止蝕價。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">九龍倉置業(1997)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$35</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　-</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DdPb1gKL3W1791347846.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T05:59:19.307176+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}